      "created_at": "2015-05-29T14:30:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>An idea that struck me the other day after playing a couple rounds of games -- has anyone thought out/tried a competitive game? Two teams of heroes against one another, with no villain? What kind of modifications, if any, would be needed to balance this sort of thing? Off the top of my head, I imagine it'd have to work like the Vengeance pack, where the players of different teams alternate instead of all of them going, then all the others going.</p><p>Thoughts?</p>",
