    {
      "id": 142325,
      "name": "cmschex",
      "username": "cmschex",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/e9bcb4/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-05-29T15:22:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"mwc146\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n mwc146:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Pydro wrote:</b><br><blockquote>There was a forum game like that, it didn't work out so well.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nWhat happened?\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The game is just not balanced that way so leads to broken combos. &nbsp;In the forum game it was thematic Ww2 Bunker, AG Legacy, Argent vs Chrono, Omni X and (cant remember 3rd one). &nbsp;Ongoing/Equip Destruction was really powerful, extra power usage could essntially shut down other heroes. &nbsp;Incap abilities had the same potential as well and a lot of cards have to have an impartial judge to rule on them. &nbsp;So, in short, it can work, but don't expect an especially gun or balanced experience. &nbsp;Play Tactics</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:19:33.723Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
