      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[quote=\"mwc146\"]\n\n&nbsp;\n<div class=\"bb-quote\"><b>Pydro wrote:</b><br /><blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\">There was a forum game like that, it didn&#39;t work out so well.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nWhat happened?\n\n[/quote]\n\n&nbsp;\n\nThe game is just not balanced that way so leads to broken combos. &nbsp;In the forum game it was thematic Ww2 Bunker, AG Legacy, Argent vs Chrono, Omni X and (cant remember 3rd one). &nbsp;Ongoing/Equip Destruction was really powerful, extra power usage could essntially shut down other heroes. &nbsp;Incap abilities had the same potential as well and a lot of cards have to have an impartial judge to rule on them. &nbsp;So, in short, it can work, but don&#39;t expect an especially gun or balanced experience. &nbsp;Play Tactics\n",
