      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/animus/{size}/1887_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-01-21T19:26:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I had the same thought about Civil War and SotM, then a forum search led me here.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Arcanist Lupus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Arcanist Lupus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Yes. It's called Tactics.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>What if Tactics isn't your thing? What if you wanted the card game experience, but with hero v. hero?&nbsp;</p>\n<p>And remember, before Vengeance (and later Villains), the only way to play was hero team vs. 1 villain.</p>\n<p>It's possible to be done, and done well. Unfortunately, I think it is unlikely in any official capacity.</p>",
